+### Formulas
+*   Normal conversion: $\mathbf{n} = 2 \cdot \mathbf{c}_{normal} - 1$, where $\mathbf{c}_{normal}$ is the color value from `normal_texture` [S1, unofficial].
+*   Occlusion factor: $f_{occlusion} = 1.0 - \frac{\text{hit}}{4}$ [S1, unofficial].
+*   Ray direction construction in camera space: $\mathbf{d} = \text{normalize}(\text{screenCoord}.x \cdot (-\mathbf{c}_{right}) \cdot \tan(\text{halfFov}) \cdot \mathbf{c}_{settings}.y + \text{screenCoord}.y \cdot \mathbf{c}_{up} \cdot \tan(\text{halfFov}) + \mathbf{c}_{forward})$ [S1, unofficial].
 
